eviews data monthly during LSA supervision. Formal review at half-termly MDT meetings with component-by-component progress reporting. Annual comprehensive assessment by SLT using standardized social communication assessments to measure overall progress</em></strong><br><br><strong><em>Rationale: NEED 6 describes core ASD-related social communication difficulties that are fundamental to Amelia's profile. These skills do not develop incidentally and require systematic, explicit teaching. The multi-component approach ensures all areas are addressed while the integration into existing provision hours maximizes efficiency. This provision directly supports outcomes E1(i), E1(ii), E1(iv), and E2</em></strong></div>
